# NOTE: .Renviron is intentionally NOT excluded here.
# shinyapps.io has no environment-variable / secrets manager at all (confirmed
# via Posit staff on the community forum, Nov 2024 - that feature only exists
# on Connect/Connect Cloud, not shinyapps.io). Bundling .Renviron into the
# deploy is the only way this app's OPENAI_API_KEY reaches production.
# .Renviron is still git-ignored (see .gitignore) so it never touches the
# public GitHub repo - the only place it lives besides this machine is the
# private shinyapps.io deploy bundle, which is not public.
